{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11218","headline":"暮登四安寺钟楼寄裴十 · 杜甫","name":"暮登四安寺钟楼寄裴十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮倚高楼对雪峰，僧来不语自鸣钟。\n孤城返照红将歛，近市浮烟翠且重。\n多病独愁常閴寂，故人相见未从容。\n知君苦思缘诗瘦，大向交游万事慵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}